omment"},{"id":160682894,"discussion_id":"43ec249c04fd64668a72fc54c4ed9b030d0aa06f","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n ansen-changan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:40+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:40+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160682902,"discussion_id":"c55f46e61fb30a3a4b80f60b325994805ed0476c","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:42+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160682907,"discussion_id":"1e2f49676699753b049b45491e3f26aea967ffe3","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T11:51:43+08:00","user":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160682977,"discussion_id":"a00f6cb76ac9837fc84b689c6bd6f7310bdad506","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化FlashAttention梯度计算内核中`SubGrapB`函数的执行顺序。主要解决了在启用Sink机制时，数据拷贝输出操作与Sink相关计算之间存在的潜在依赖关系问题。通过调整执行顺序，确保了计算逻辑的正确性和数据流的清晰性，避免了因执行时序不当可能引发的逻辑错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是将`SubGrapB`函数末尾负责将结果`vecCopyOutBuffer`拷贝到全局内存`mulWorkSpaceGm`的代码块，整体移动至函数内部的Sink处理逻辑代码块之后。这一调整确保了当Sink机制启用时，必须先完成对`dsinkSumLocal`的累加等Sink相关计算，再执行最终的数据输出，从而理顺了数据依赖关系，保证了计算结果的正确性。本次变更属于代码逻辑重构，不涉及算法或外部接口的根本性改变。","created_at":"2026-01-21T11:52:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T11:52:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160683126,"discussion_id":"0665fb93d9d7c93ddc0f2af98d317f2d033186a4","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=2d2e544cf23f4c2dbe78573f6b444a7e&projectName=CANN'>2d2e544cf23f4c2dbe78573f6b444a7e</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                            <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/02fee9de-45c2-4f5f-a39f-b1036df1dd1f/CANN/ops-transformer?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>Check_Pr</strong></td>\n    